{"summary":"One-tap drifting game: master tight turns, avoid obstacles, beat your high score","description":"Sling Drift is a fast-paced arcade racing game where everything comes down to perfect timing and well-executed drifts. Take on sharp turns, avoid crashes, and see how far your drifting skills can take you.\n\nThe mechanics are simple: tap and hold to swing your car around each turn, then release at the right moment to straighten out and keep moving. It’s easy to learn, but staying consistent requires focus and precision.\n\nEach run puts your reflexes and coordination to the test. As you progress, the tracks become more challenging and the pace picks up.\n\nGame features:\n\nSimple one-tap controls\nSmooth and responsive gameplay\nIncreasing difficulty with each run\nUnlockable cars with different handling styles\nClean and minimalist visual design\n\nCollect coins, improve your performance, and unlock new cars as you go. Try different vehicles and find the one that best fits your playstyle.\n\nSling Drift is a great pick for players who enjoy skill-based racing games and quick play sessions.","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$0.99 - $5.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/UjBD0yEKT2I?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Xc1SaeNxQsvtlt-tAP9baCqV6-XTLZyXoBJdWEro0WPuWxUKo0QUwHw09NQXCboSCqxt8A58mj2qUNSRXtPa--w","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yP1wdKwJi6itstMFjQWVVuOyZD3v-6ShWLCWma_kzKQ44WKcsuZEqhPgXTShor_pQTmSfGZSt9MiU6w7rVa7xg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/VYmCCIBw4Hk-rNrnhw5Du-sbj7tFJu1ltFPC-hN4nf1phZsPArhu_y1GRsKh5L2sJEyMvRhVtFXWJxshHw3b0Q","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Lz42w0zCdqkO2VBL-_N9AWcOQTT2z-eWrmJ4HzTSF1CeGo477sWvL4OoiQ04GwK_NuX6JGKp5vz1khLBe7LW","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/kh22yR6vVZhwyKyVg9b9dQZW5Z9kaNJVdoQwq8Ftbnfz3AgHgelt8qgDdz5LOf2KTX8sRK3Ggxodt7YJcbbcsIA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/hNfvVCO91Yz88oLKOP6Vcdh2